rgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commit/eff90a298fd45e77710840efef2c87ea422c8bd4","node_id":"C_kwDOP0-notoAKGVmZjkwYTI5OGZkNDVlNzc3MTA4NDBlZmVmMmM4N2VhNDIyYzhiZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commit/748b250d0bfc73068ed20dc3548945c756f582ec","sha":"748b250d0bfc73068ed20dc3548945c756f582ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commits/748b250d0bfc73068ed20dc3548945c756f582ec"}],"sha":"eff90a298fd45e77710840efef2c87ea422c8bd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commits/eff90a298fd45e77710840efef2c87ea422c8bd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234184950?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skytion1","id":234184950,"login":"skytion1","node_id":"U_kgDODfVg9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commits/748b250d0bfc73068ed20dc3548945c756f582ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-01T09:55:42Z","email":"234184950+skytion1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"skytion1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-01T09:55:42Z","email":"234184950+skytion1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"skytion1"},"message":"feat: Diwali launch - WhatsApp-first ordering with comprehensive deployment guide\n\n🎆 DIWALI SPECIAL LAUNCH IMPLEMENTATION\n\n## 🚀 Quick Launch Strategy (1-2 Days)\nImplemented \"Catalog + WhatsApp\" model for fast Diwali deployment:\n- Browse products online → Order via WhatsApp → Manual fulfillment\n- No payment gateway complexity for rapid launch\n- All existing features preserved for post-Diwali enhancement\n\n## ✨ B2C E-Commerce Enhancements\n\n### Homepage Updates (src/app/page.tsx)\n- ✅ Added prominent Diwali banner with gold gradient animations\n- ✅ Enhanced WhatsApp ordering (3 strategic CTAs):\n  * Hero section: Direct WhatsApp button\n  * Features: Dedicated \"WhatsApp Ordering\" card\n  * Final CTA: Large prominent WhatsApp action\n- ✅ Pre-filled WhatsApp messages for better UX\n- ✅ Maintained all existing features (no deletions)\n\n### WhatsApp Integration\n- Environment-based phone number configuration\n- Context-aware pre-filled messages\n- Mobile-optimized button styling\n- Instant response messaging\n\n## 📦 B2B Portal Configuration\n\n### Team Operations\n- Created comprehensive TEAM_GUIDE.md\n- Product management workflows\n- Daily checklists for Diwali season\n- Pricing strategies and best practices\n- Image upload guidelines\n- Common issues troubleshooting\n\n### Environment Templates\n- Production environment configuration\n- WorkOS authentication setup\n- API connectivity configuration\n- Feature flags for gradual rollout\n\n## 🌐 Deployment Infrastructure\n\n### Vercel Configuration\n- Created vercel.json for B2C deployment\n- Mumbai region optimization (bom1)\n- Security headers implementation\n- Build optimization settings\n\n### Environment Management\n- Production templates for B2C (.env.production.template)\n- Production templates for B2B (.env.production.template)\n- Clear documentation for all variables\n- Security best practices\n\n## 📚 Comprehensive Documentation\n\n### 1. DIWALI_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md (Main Guide)\n- Step-by-step deployment instructions\n- Vercel & Render deployment procedures\n- DNS configuration guide\n- Environment variable setup\n- Testing checklist\n- Troubleshooting section\n- Cost breakdown ($14/month minimal)\n\n### 2. TEAM_GUIDE.md (Operations)\n- Product management workflows\n- Adding/editing products\n- Category management\n- Pricing updates\n- Image best practices\n- Daily operation checklists\n\n### 3. IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md (Overview)\n- Complete changes documentation\n- Technical standards maintained\n- Deployment readiness checklist\n- Post-Diwali enhancement roadmap\n- Success metrics and KPIs\n\n## 🎨 Brand Consistency Maintained\n\n### Design System\n- Royal/Luxury color theme throughout\n- Consistent typography (Playfair Display, Inter)\n- Shared brand configuration\n- Professional animations (shimmer, float, glow)\n\n### Assets Added\n- Brand logos for both portals\n- Centralized brand config (brandConfig.ts)\n- Color mappings (colorMappings.ts)\n- Reusable component patterns\n\n## 💰 Cost Structure\n\n### Minimal Launch Setup\n- Vercel (B2C): FREE (Hobby tier)\n- Render B2B Portal: $7/month (Starter)\n- Render API Gateway: $7/month (Starter)\n- **Total: $14/month**\n\n## ✅ Quality Assurance\n\n### Code Standards\n- TypeScript strict mode maintained\n- No ESLint errors introduced\n- Consistent component patterns\n- Proper error handling\n- Type safety throughout\n\n### Architecture\n- Monorepo structure preserved\n- Shared components library intact\n- Environment-based configuration\n- Modular, scalable design\n\n## 📱 Customer Journey (New)\n\n1. Customer lands on shop.harshadelights.com\n2. Sees Diwali banner and featured products\n3. Browses catalog (categories, search, filters)\n4. Clicks \"Order via WhatsApp\"\n5. WhatsApp opens with pre-filled product details\n6. Direct conversation with team\n7. Manual order fulfillment\n\n## 🔄 Post-Diwali Roadmap\n\n### Phase 2 Features (Preserved in Code)\n- Stripe/Razorpay payment integration\n- User authentication & accounts\n- Order history & tracking\n- Automated order processing\n- Email/SMS notifications\n- Inventory sync with ERP\n- Customer reviews system\n- AWS migration\n\n## 🎯 Key Benefits\n\n1. **Fast Launch**: 1-2 day deployment timeline\n2. **Low Risk**: No payment gateway complexity\n3. **Personal Touch**: Direct WhatsApp communication\n4. **Scalable**: All features ready for activation\n5. **Professional**: Beautiful UI, brand consistency\n6. **Cost Effective**: $14/month minimal infrastructure\n\n## 📊 Files Changed\n\n### Created (8 files):\n- DIWALI_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md\n- IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md\n- frontend-applications/02-b2c-ecommerce/.env.production.template\n- frontend-applications/02-b2c-ecommerce/vercel.json\n- frontend-applications/03-b2b-portal/.env.production.template\n- frontend-applications/03-b2b-portal/TEAM_GUIDE.md\n- frontend-applications/shared/src/lib/brandConfig.ts\n- frontend-applications/shared/src/lib/colorMappings.ts\n\n### Modified (1 critical file):\n- frontend-applications/02-b2c-ecommerce/src/app/page.tsx\n\n### Plus Previous Changes:\n- Various styling and component updates\n- Brand assets and logos\n- Tailwind configuration refinements\n\n## 🚀 Ready for Deployment\n\n✅ Code: Production-ready\n✅ Documentation: Comprehensive guides\n✅ Configuration: Templates provided\n⚠️ Environment: Needs actual values\n⚠️ Infrastructure: Needs Vercel/Render setup\n\n## 🎆 Launch Checklist\n\n- [ ] Fill environment variables\n- [ ] Get WhatsApp business number\n- [ ] Deploy to Vercel\n- [ ] Deploy to Render\n- [ ] Configure DNS\n- [ ] Test thoroughly\n- [ ] Train team on B2B portal\n\n---\n\n🪔 Ready to light up this Diwali with online presence! 🪔\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code (https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e824c129df78fd455ab4dbca81628bd583944558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/trees/e824c129df78fd455ab4dbca81628bd583944558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/commits/748b250d0bfc73068ed20dc3548945c756f582ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234184950?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skytion1","id":234184950,"login":"skytion1","node_id":"U_kgDODfVg9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commit/748b250d0bfc73068ed20dc3548945c756f582ec","node_id":"C_kwDOP0-notoAKDc0OGIyNTBkMGJmYzczMDY4ZWQyMGRjMzU0ODk0NWM3NTZmNTgyZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commit/c3b73c50dc9a70a9f690c2159e13c9ec1517ac0a","sha":"c3b73c50dc9a70a9f690c2159e13c9ec1517ac0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ha