6f9f5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-30T08:42:07Z","email":"234184950+skytion1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"skytion1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-30T08:42:07Z","email":"234184950+skytion1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"skytion1"},"message":"feat: complete product catalog restoration and B2B order management system\n\n🎯 MAJOR FEATURE COMPLETION:\n\n## Product Catalog Restoration\n- ✅ Removed all mock data fallbacks from B2C product catalog\n- ✅ Updated src/lib/data/products.ts to use real API Gateway integration\n- ✅ Removed mock products array from Redux store (productsSlice.ts)\n- ✅ Enhanced error handling to throw proper errors instead of hiding failures\n- ✅ Created comprehensive B2B products data service with pricing transformations\n\n## B2B Order Management System\n- ✅ NEW: Complete B2B orders data service (src/lib/data/orders.ts)\n  - getB2BOrdersList() with pagination, filtering, search\n  - getB2BOrder() for single order details\n  - createB2BOrder() for new order creation\n  - updateB2BOrderStatus() for order lifecycle management\n  - cancelB2BOrder() with reason tracking\n  - getB2BOrderInvoice() for PDF generation\n  - getB2BOrderAnalytics() for business intelligence\n- ✅ UPDATED: Orders page (src/app/orders/page.tsx) with real API integration\n  - Server-side rendering with search parameters\n  - Pagination, status filtering, error handling\n  - Professional order display with status badges and actions\n\n## Environment & Configuration\n- ✅ Added API Gateway URLs to both B2C and B2B .env.local files\n- ✅ Updated TypeScript configurations for better Jest integration\n- ✅ Both applications build successfully without compilation errors\n\n## Technical Improvements\n- ✅ Proper error handling that throws errors instead of masking with mock data\n- ✅ React Server Components with cache() for optimal performance\n- ✅ Comprehensive TypeScript interfaces for all data services\n- ✅ Production-ready API integration with fallback strategies\n\n🚀 READY FOR DEPLOYMENT:\n- Product catalog uses real backend data (no mock fallbacks)\n- B2B order management fully operational\n- Both frontends tested and building successfully\n- Integration complete for customer launch\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccb21cf6be3c6aee008d8893185110d5b5f745b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/trees/ccb21cf6be3c6aee008d8893185110d5b5f745b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/commits/df6b4952fb0d06997a00edcbca91e13da56f9f5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/234184950?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/skytion1","id":234184950,"login":"skytion1","node_id":"U_kgDODfVg9g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skytion1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commit/df6b4952fb0d06997a00edcbca91e13da56f9f5c","node_id":"C_kwDOP0-notoAKGRmNmI0OTUyZmIwZDA2OTk3YTAwZWRjYmNhOTFlMTNkYTU2ZjlmNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commit/3671