b9cbddaa25c94d6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-23T00:18:33Z","email":"cloudyatraofficial@gmail.com","name":"yatraonclouds"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-23T00:18:33Z","email":"cloudyatraofficial@gmail.com","name":"yatraonclouds"},"message":"fix: comprehensive production deployment fixes with proper error handling\n\nDATADOG IMPROVEMENTS:\n- Fixed all DataDog middleware functions to handle null tracer gracefully\n- Added null checks to datadogMiddleware, trackProxyRequest, trackCircuitBreakerState, trackRateLimit, trackBusinessEvent, injectTraceId, and healthCheck functions\n- Replaced temporary ''if (false &&'' disable with smart environment-based conditional\n- DataDog now properly initializes only when DD_API_KEY is available and NODE_ENV=production\n- Prometheus metrics remain fully functional regardless of DataDog status\n\nDATABASE RESILIENCE:\n- Re-enabled database initialization with exponential backoff retry logic (3 attempts)\n- Added graceful degradation when database connection fails\n- Server can now start in ''limited mode'' without database access\n- Authentication system safely handles null database connections\n- Added comprehensive error logging for database connection issues\n\nDEPLOYMENT SAFETY:\n- Server will no longer crash if database is unavailable\n- All monitoring functions work with or without DataDog\n- Proper error handling prevents server exits\n- Health checks adapted for both full and limited operation modes\n\nThis should resolve all deployment failures and enable stable production operation.","tree":{"sha":"152fd7991e915aaeff2ea71ab6b74f77b5fa511f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/trees/152fd7991e915aaeff2ea71ab6b74f77b5fa511f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/commits/1a93f35bd045caddc5e27b80b9cbddaa25c94d6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}}