ttps://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yatraonclouds","id":214893748,"login":"yatraonclouds","node_id":"U_kgDODM8EtA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yatraonclouds","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/commits/d16d629868657bf4f44aef974089790407a252a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-23T00:07:08Z","email":"cloudyatraofficial@gmail.com","name":"yatraonclouds"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-23T00:07:08Z","email":"cloudyatraofficial@gmail.com","name":"yatraonclouds"},"message":"fix: disable DataDog tracing to resolve fs.existsSync deprecation error\n\nROOT CAUSE FOUND: The fs.existsSync deprecation warning was coming from dd-trace package\nin node_modules/dd-trace/packages/dd-trace/src/guardrails/telemetry.js, not our code\n\nIMMEDIATE FIX:\n- Temporarily disable DataDog tracing initialization for initial deployment\n- Added conditional logic to prevent dd-trace module loading\n- This eliminates the third-party fs.existsSync(undefined) call\n- Server should now start without deprecation warnings or crashes\n\nFUTURE: Once server is running, we can properly configure DataDog with correct environment variables","tree":{"sha":"70e1a74afc8d67fa1719cc40d5843586506294d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/trees/70e1a74afc8d67fa1719cc40d5843586506294d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harshadelight1999-eng/harshadelights/git/commits/d16d629868657bf4f44aef974