on of Done\n- Docs block: shared docs for people and agents\n- Quiz rows appear on click with clearer examples\n- \"Инварианты\" → \"правила\"; review config shown as blocks instead of YAML\n- Explain pass@k / pass^k, shorten \"Зачем evals\", add \"Как связать скилл и eval\"\n- Clearer Run A vs Run B comparison; restore the original closing slide\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UZMiwcjrNBUC3GLiCeH1Ui\n\n* presentation: smooth awkward wording in slides and file excerpts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UZMiwcjrNBUC3GLiCeH1Ui\n\n* presentation: fix skill-eval example and explorer highlights; add review plan\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UZMiwcjrNBUC3GLiCeH1Ui\n\n* presentation: apply review plan — real antiexamples, fair runs, checked facts\n\n- Run A gets the bad spec from demo-before; evals/ hidden in both runs\n- Antiexamples from demo-before: AGENTS.md, old architecture doc, check:ai,\n  new \"команда агентов\" slide\n- Run A vs Run B compared by the four causes from the \"why models err\" slide\n- Facts checked: AA Index v4.3, Böckeler taxonomy, TW Radar, ETH AGENTS.md\n  study, SWE-Bench+, Kiro EARS; CodeSpeak and ready-made skills moved to backup\n- code-review skill introduced, checks-reviewer naming, 5 000-line log fixture,\n  eval criterion marked manual, SDD spelled out, 25-vs-2 microfrontends note\n- review-plan.md now tracks what is done and what is left\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UZMiwcjrNBUC3GLiCeH1Ui\n\n* presentation: link the rewritten demo step commits\n\nThe demo/agent-ready-v2 step commits now carry the cross-zone,\nDefinition of Done and «Правила» renames, so the slides point at the new\nSHAs and drop the note about old names in the step 