ub.com","name":"Beck Bekmyradov"},"message":"feat: improve service health check UX and refactor component architecture\n\nBREAKING CHANGES:\n- Refactored plugin initialization flow to check service readiness before loading data\n- Removed immediate data loading from componentDidMount\n\nFeatures:\n- Add modular component architecture with single responsibility principle\n  - ErrorAlert: dismissible error notifications\n  - ServiceStatusIndicator: clickable service health status button\n  - ServiceStatusDetails: detailed service status dropdown\n  - ServiceWarningBanner: prominent warning when services starting\n  - ContentOverlay: disables UI with overlay when services not ready\n- Implement smart data loading that waits for service readiness\n- Add automatic data refresh when services become ready\n- Display content with disabled overlay instead of hiding it completely\n- Show errors as top banners instead of blocking entire view\n\nImprovements:\n- Separate service health check interval from data refresh interval\n- Create dedicated methods for interval management (setupPeriodicHealthCheck, setupDataRefreshIfServicesReady)\n- Add areServicesReady() utility method for centralized readiness checks\n- Improve user messaging for service startup (updated to 1-15 minutes timeframe)\n- Enhance componentDidUpdate logic to detect service readiness transitions\n- Add cleanupIntervals method for proper resource management\n\nTechnical:\n- Move service health check logic into isolated methods\n- Implement periodic health checks every 30 seconds\n- Add conditional data refresh based on service status\n- Export reusable UI components for better maintainability\n- Improve error handling with non-blocking error displays\n\nUX Improvements:\n- Users can now see the plugin interface while services are starting\n- Clear visual feedback when services are not ready\n- Dismissible error messages that don''t block content\n- Detailed service status available on-click\n- Better loading states and transitions","tree":{"sha":"c816921f565f1bc24acc376af4b4317b9d9d9b5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/document-chat-plugin-dev/git/trees/c816921f565f1bc24acc376af4b4317b9d9d9b5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/document-chat-plugin-dev/git/commits/5c3a708a155fe1b9fcd056e52aba5da8541951a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47065940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov","id":47065940,"login":"bekmuradov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDY1OTQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bekmuradov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/document-chat-plugin-dev/commit/5c3a708a155fe1b9fcd056e52aba5da8541951a1","node_id":"C_kwDOP1UdyNoAKDVjM2E3MDhhMTU1ZmUxYjlmY2QwNTZlNTJhYmE1ZGE4NTQxOTUxYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bekmuradov/document-chat-plugin-dev/commit/2375f9dcddec6ef200a2fc3dc91e8617ac60e83c","sha":"2375f9dcddec6ef200a2fc3dc91e8617ac60e83c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmuradov/document-chat-plugin-dev/commits/2375f9dcddec6ef200a2fc3dc91e8617ac60e83c"}],"sha":"5c3a708a155fe1b9fcd056e52aba5da8541951a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bekmurado