dependency security vulnerabilities (11 total, 0 high/critical)\n- Update Angular build tools to compatible secure versions\n- Fix project configuration paths and TypeScript references\n- Clean up ESLint configuration for flat config format\n- Ensure all commands work: build, lint, serve\n\nBreaking changes:\n- Removed Jest unit testing framework\n- Removed Playwright E2E testing framework\n- Updated to Cucumber-based BDD testing approach\n- Updated dependency versions for security fixes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(shell): initialize micro-client shell application with module federation setup\n\n- Added bootstrap file to bootstrap the Angular application.\n- Created index.html for the shell application with a root component.\n- Implemented main.ts to fetch module federation manifest and register remotes.\n- Added global styles in styles.css.\n- Configured TypeScript settings in tsconfig.app.json and tsconfig.editor.json.\n- Defined main TypeScript configuration in tsconfig.json with strict settings.\n- Set up webpack configuration for module federation.\n- Added .gitkeep file in micro-services directory for version control.\n\n* chore: update documentation and code for Cucumber testing and Nx configuration\n\n- Updated CLAUDE.md to mark Cucumber test commands as TODO.\n- Modified CONTRIBUTING.md to indicate testing requirements as TODO.\n- Revised README.md to clarify that the template will use Cucumber for BDD testing.\n- Fixed schema path in project.json for the shell application.\n- Commented out all tests in app.component.spec.ts for future implementation.\n- Adjusted app.component.ts to remove NxWelcomeComponent from imports.\n- Corrected import order in app.routes.ts for consistency.\n- Fixed promise handling in main.ts for better error handling.\n- Updated tsconfig.app.json to target ES2022.\n- Changed e2eTestRunner configuration in nx.json to \"none\".\n- Upgraded @typescript-eslint packages in package-lock.json and package.json to version 8.40.0.\n\n* refactor(nx-welcome): remove unused CommonModule import\n\n* feat(routes): update route to use dynamic component loading for NxWelcomeComponent\n\n* feat(migrations): add migration configurations for Nx v22 updates and enhancements\n\n* chore: upgrade Angular, NestJS, and NgRx dependencies to latest versions\n\n- Updated Angular dependencies from version 18.x to 19.x\n- Updated NestJS dependencies from version 10.x to 11.x\n- Updated NgRx dependencies from version 18.x to 19.x\n- Added CHANGELOG.md documenting security fixes and breaking changes\n\n* fix: update zone.js to 0.15.0 for Angular 19 compatibility\n\n- Updated zone.js from ~0.14.3 to ~0.15.0\n- Resolves peer dependency conflict with @angular/core@19.2.17\n- Updated package-lock.json accordingly\n\n* chore: update package.json to latest dependencies and maintain consistency\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: code@davejackson.dev <code@davejackson.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"d981468c08e26719491e1eadc8a10d1256eecad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dave-jackson-dev/nx-ng-nest-cucumber-stack/git/trees/d981468c08e26719491e1eadc8a10d1256eecad4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dave-jackson-dev/nx-ng-nest-cucumber-stack/git/commits/773fd6646a6bd2f8d49b098f4176088457527362","verification":{"payload":"tree d981468c08e26719491e1eadc8a10d1256eecad4\nparent ab1e82370aa96eda593a0fb94f71b91ae9520c54\nauthor Dave Jackson <hello@davejackson.dev> 1765826648 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1765826648 -0600\n\nfeat: adds-micro-frontend-shell (#1)\n\n* feat: initialize Angular shell application with Module Federation\n\n- Created bootstrap file to bootstrap the Angular application.\n- Added index.html for the main application entry point.\n- Implemented main.ts to register remote modules for Module Federation.\n- Added global styles in styles.css.\n- Set up Jest testing environment in test-setup.ts.\n- Configured TypeScript settings in tsconfig files for application, editor, and specs.\n- Established Webpack configuration for Module Federation.\n- Documented project planning and architecture for DDD and microservices.\n- Set up Jest and Playwright configurations for testing.\n- Created end-to-end tests for the shell application.\n\n* refactor: remove Jest/Playwright, fix dependencies and security vulnerabilities\n\n- Remove all Jest and Playwright dependencies and configurations\n- Replace with Cucumber-only testing approach (BDD)\n- Update all documentation to reflect new testing strategy\n- Fix dependency security vulnerabilities (11 total, 0 high/critical)\n- Update Angular build tools to compatible secure versions\n- Fix project configuration paths and TypeScript references\n- Clean up ESLint configuration for flat config format\n- Ensure all commands work: build, lint, serve\n\nBreaking changes:\n- Removed Jest unit testing framework\n- Removed Playwright E2E testing framework\n- Updated to Cucumber-based BDD testing approach\n- Updated dependency versions for security fixes\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(shell): initialize micro-client shell application with module federation setup\n\n- Added bootstrap file to bootstrap the Angular application.\n- Created index.html for the shell application with a root component.\n- Implemented main.ts to fetch module federation manifest and register remotes.\n- Added global styles in styles.css.\n- Configured TypeScript settings in tsconfig.app.json and tsconfig.editor.json.\n- Defined main TypeScript configuration in tsconfig.json with strict settings.\n- Set up webpack configuration for module federation.\n- Added .gitkeep file in micro-services directory for version control.\n\n* chore: update documentation and code for Cucumber testing and Nx configuration\n\n- Updated CLAUDE.md to mark Cucumber test commands as TODO.\n- Modified CONTRIBUTING.md to indicate testing requirements as TODO.\n- Revised README.md to clarify that the template will use Cucumber for BDD testing.\n- Fixed schema path in project.json for the shell application.\n- Commented out all tests in app.component.spec.ts for future implementation.\n- Adjusted app.component.ts to remove NxWelcomeComponent from imports.\n- Corrected import order in app.routes.ts for consistency.\n- Fixed promise handling in main.ts for better error handling.\n- Updated tsconfig.app.json to target ES2022.\n- Changed e2eTestRunner configuration in nx.json to \"none\".\n- Upgraded @typescript-eslint packages in package-lock.json and package.json to version 8.40.0.\n\n* refactor(nx-welcome): remove unused CommonModule import\n\n* feat(routes): update route to use dynamic component loading for NxWelcomeComponent\n\n* feat(migrations): add migration configurations for Nx v22 updates and enhancements\n\n* chore: upgrade Angular, NestJS, and NgRx dependencies to latest versions\n\n- Updated Angular dependencies from version 18.x to 19.x\n- Updated NestJS dependencies from version 10.x to 11.x\n- Updated NgRx dependencies from version 18.x to 19.x\n- Added CHANGELOG.md documenting security fixes and breaking changes\n\n* fix: update zone.js to 0.15.0 for Angular 19 compatibility\n\n- Updated zone.js from ~0.14.3 to ~0.15.0\n- Resolves peer dependency conflict with @angular/core@19.2.17\n- Updated package-lock.json accordingly\n\n* chore: update package.json to latest dependencies and maintain consistency\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: code@davejackson.dev <code@davejackson.dev>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpQGBYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6JMQAFZS/NKonUXem9SQKwQXZWbm\nlxoRXn3s5aisoYRNZEA