"2026-10-08T02:33:30Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:30Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(campaign-studio): Items section for loot and treasure\n\nAdds the `item` campaign prep kind end to end: game-contracts schema,\nserver kind lists and dependency resolver, and migration\n2026-10-07-add-item-kind.sql (startup-registered; updates\ncampaign_objects_kind_check and schema.sql).\n\nThe studio gains an Items section between Encounters and Maps: items\ngrouped by holder (party, NPC, location, encounter, unassigned) with\nrarity/discovery filters, autosaved detail with holder, quests and\ndiscovered/identified flags, and Remove. Encounters show Loot, NPCs\nCarries, and locations Items here. An optional \"Start from SRD\" picker\nprefills from the rules catalog and hides itself when the catalog is\nunavailable. Items index into related groups, @mentions and the map\nLink Object picker.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"41120d46b78e53114936353d0ada46403bad7a42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/41120d46b78e53114936353d0ada46403bad7a42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/dd07ad647e8df658b3b3a1278b2c57073bb00c9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","recei