4361f6ee54a6c10734d7b4f4713664e821f9a7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:03Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:03Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(campaign-studio): Assets media library and map image replacement\n\nNew Assets section lists the user''s uploaded and generated images with\n\"used in this campaign\" / \"all\" views, category and tag search, a\ndetail pane with autosaved name and tags, usage links, upload, and\npermanent removal. Maps get a Replace image picker (implements\nmap.asset.replace).\n\nServer: asset-service PATCH for name/tags and createdAt on new assets;\nthe VTT gateway refuses DELETE of an asset still referenced by any of\nthe owner''s non-archived campaign objects (409 with references) and\nforwards JSON bodies through the /api/user proxy. Uploaded /users/\nimages now resolve in the studio, and dev proxies /users.\n\nFix: generated-map uploads used a different dev fallback secret than\nthe asset service; both now share getAssetServiceSecret().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8610abd9b42a48fa1e35b46d3896b45e771e65b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/a8610abd9b42a48fa1e35b46d3896b45e771e65b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/14361f6ee54a6c10734d7b4f4713664e821f9a7d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/14361f6ee54a6c10734d7b4f4713664e821f9a7d","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDE0MzYxZjZlZTU0YTZjMTA3MzRkN2I0ZjQ3MTM2NjRlODIxZjlhN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/a36efc048099a9d36a3ef8d3816cd21914185a6c","sha":"a36efc048099a9d36a3ef8d3816cd21914185a6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/a36efc048099a9d36a3ef8d3816cd21914185a6c"}],"sha":"14361f6ee54a6c10734d7b4f4713664e821f9a7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/14361f6ee54a6c10734d7b4f4713664e821f9a7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/a36efc048099a9d36a3ef8d3816cd21914185a6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:32:47Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:32:47Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(campaign-studio): autosave on blur and a single sidebar on the map page\n\nEditableSection now saves each field when focus leaves it (selects and\ncheckboxes on change), serializes saves so revisions never collide,\nflushes pending edits on navigation/unmount, and replaces Save/Cancel\nwith Done plus an inline Saving…/Saved status; conflicts pause\nautosave. A useEditableCommit() hook lets non-focusable controls\n(encounter monster rows, quest objectives) commit. Map preparation\nautosaves pin/layer/link changes on a debounce with retry on failure.\n\nThe map editor''s second navigation rail is removed (one studio\nsidebar, Maps highlighted), its dead options button is replaced by\nRemove, and \"World\" is relabelled \"World & Locations\".\n\nSection files also wire the Remove button and the Items section''s\nheld-items lists, and MapPreparation includes the corrected\ncampaign-object pin ref, used by later commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5d5d3a6fea26ba5434da13ce00a5b99c268d449","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/c5d5d3a6fea26ba5434da13ce00a5b99c268d449"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/a36efc048099a9d36a3ef8d3816cd21914185a6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://