false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/ebdfe4d72663ffec1a36d25328f05534cff220de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:32:16Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:32:16Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(campaign-studio): remove (archive) campaign items with undo\n\nEvery prep object can now be removed. Removal is a soft delete to the\nexisting `archived` status via new POST .../archive and .../restore\nroutes (revision CAS, DM-only); archived objects drop out of listings\nand backlinks. The studio gains a ConfirmDialog that lists backlinks\nbefore removal, a RemoveItemButton with an Undo toast, and remove\ncontrols on map cards and session details.\n\nShared files (bundle store/API client, prep routes/repository) also\ncarry hunks used by the later Assets and Items commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29917da337cd82c0800a1af1a0f4bb491d34751f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/29917da337cd82c0800a1af1a0f4bb491d34751f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/ebdfe4d72663ffec1a36d25328f05534cff220de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/ebdfe4d72663ffec1a36d25328f05534cff220de","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKGViZGZlNGQ3MjY2M2ZmZWMxYTM2ZDI1MzI4ZjA1NTM0Y2ZmMjIwZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/0daa07b458c2d8250de80b1b8aad4581abce4326","sha":"0daa07b458c2d8250de80b1b8aad4581abce4326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/0daa07b458c2d8250de80b1b8aad4581abce4326"}],"sha":"ebdfe4d72663ffec1a36d25328f05534cff220de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/ebdfe4d72663ffec1a36d25328f05534cff220de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/0daa07b458c2d8250de80b1b8aad4581abce4326/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:50:07Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:50:07Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(map-studio): docked sidebar with tabs, presets, sticky Add to Scene and action acknowledgements\n\nReplaces the floating card over the map with a sidebar beside the generator iframe (left/right dock, resizable, collapsible to an icon rail, bottom sheet on narrow screens).\n\n- Generate/Style/Layers/Output tabs and preset chips rendered from the action registry; search when a generator has many actions\n- Sticky footer with scene status, a preview of the cached map, and Add to Scene; inline errors instead of alert()\n- Bridges acknowledge each action (ACTION_RESULT -> generator/action-result); buttons show pending, time out after 4s, and Add to Scene waits for the export that follows an action\n- [ collapses the sidebar, Ctrl/Cmd+Enter adds to the scene\n- Remove GeneratorFloatingControls; add plan doc\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29ea10fa6f36f93c0bb07be5566597d57e03c279","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/29ea10fa6f36f93c0bb07be5566597d57e03c279"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/0daa07b458c2d8250de80b1b8aad4581abce4326","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","