ale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/e781dee1d80b987cdd4f8135da236ed32c52f604/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:30:11Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T22:30:11Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(generators): per-generator action registry so Map Studio buttons send the right keys\n\nEach hub generator has its own key map; the panel sent the dungeon''s keys to all of them (e.g. G opened a window in City, N toggled tunnels in Cave and did nothing in Dwellings). Buttons and the shortcut list now render from a registry verified against each generator''s key handler.\n\nBridges re-export after every action (not a short key list) so \"Add to Scene\" no longer captures a stale map after toggles like grid in Dwellings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb8b45d85f233052ecf6850b882f2a75c61bd2ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/eb8b45d85f233052ecf6850b882f2a75c61bd2ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/e781dee1d80b987cdd4f8135da236ed32c52f604","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizat