Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:31:58Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(campaign-studio): generate maps with the VTT generators; real map uploads\n\nGenerate tab in the map picker: choose Dungeon, Cave, City, World or Dwelling, use the hub''s own controls in an embedded frame, then ''Use this map'' exports the image over postMessage (origin and window checked), rejects a blank export, saves it through /api/generated-maps and creates the map with the real asset id and URL. Signed-out users get a sign-in message.\n\nUpload tab now uploads the file as a real maps asset (JPEG, PNG or WebP up to 5 MB, validated up front) instead of saving a data URL and a made-up id, so uploaded maps survive a reload.\n\nasset-service: generated maps are registered in the user''s asset manifest (so GET /user/:id/assets lists them and a plan that uses one passes dependency resolution), delete finds files in the generated folder, and the VTT proxy forwards the map name and generator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"542d52b695ac374e618e0f410414c02d5e3ed636","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/542d52b695ac374e618e0f410414c02d5e3ed636"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/691fb05c1cb13d15cd7a35528247bfb7d7ced080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/691fb05c1cb13d15cd7a35528247bfb7d7ced080","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDY5MWZiMDVjMWNiMTNkMTVjZDdhMzU1MjgyNDdiZmI3ZDdjZWQwODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/7a075ab7ea4ce9a565ea0af4eee35210c05cf72e","sha":"7a075ab7ea4ce9a565ea0af4eee35210c05cf72e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/7a075ab7ea4ce9a565ea0af4eee35210c05cf72e"}],"sha":"691fb05c1cb13d15cd7a35528247bfb7d7ced080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/691fb05c1cb13d15cd7a35528247bfb7d7ced080"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/7a075ab7ea4ce9a565ea0af4eee35210c05cf72e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:10:54Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:10:54Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(campaign-studio): saved maps keep a loadable image; faster library picker; Add Map beside Upload map\n\n- campaignMapSchema gains an optional imageUrl (path or http(s) URL, never inline data). The bundle store saves and loads it, so a picked map still shows after a reload instead of resolving to a dead /api/assets/<id> URL.\n- resolveMapImage looks bundled battle maps (default-map-N) up in a generated index, so maps already saved with only an id recover; unresolvable ids return empty instead of a URL that 404s. Cards use the small thumbnail.\n- The picker uses the generated index (no manifest fetch), pages 48 maps at a time, and no longer swaps a failed thumbnail for the full-size image (166 MB total versus 7.7 MB of thumbnails).\n- The dependency resolver accepts default-map-N ids so plans that use them publish.\n- Maps page: Add Map sits beside the title (or beside Upload map when empty); Upload map opens the upload tab, Add Map opens the library.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fe271847a3ec7f9fcadc7ffc5b0dec32f134674","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/7fe271847a3ec7f9fcadc7ffc5b0dec32f134674"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/7a075ab7ea4ce9a565ea0af4eee35210c05cf72e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"htt