/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/ab2cabdad42d5bd98c910155d9703e5e3d05a414/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:51:27Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T02:51:27Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"ci: move all Docker build caches to GHCR registry cache\n\nPer-image smoke-*, security-* and release-* GitHub Actions cache scopes used\nmode=max and overflowed the 10 GB repository cap (10.67 GB, 398 entries), so\nDocker caches were evicted before the next run: builds ran cold and still\nspent minutes exporting a cache nothing read.\n\n- Delivery publish now reads and writes <repository>:buildcache for every\n  image (previously only codex-ocr), and is the only writer.\n- Security container scans read the same registry cache and export nothing.\n- The Actions cache is left for npm, Trivy and Python caches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9ef41a135e1d5d6bb4d4598f59c4af5cfb0cc7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/f9ef41a135e1d5d6bb4d4598f59c4af5cfb0cc7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/ab2cabdad42d5bd98c910155d9703e5e3d05a414","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://