m/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/85961dea5ea519a4d15902eac9abed0abb9617b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T23:05:11Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T23:05:11Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(doc-processor): optional remote Ollama for extraction; default to qwen3-vl:4b\n\nqwen2.5vl:7b does not fit the 6 GB RTX A2000: Ollama put 17 of 29 layers on\nthe GPU and ran the rest on the CPU, pinning every core (~4200%) at 4-9 tok/s.\n\n- Default VLM_MODEL to qwen3-vl:4b (~3.3 GB), which runs fully on the GPU.\n- OLLAMA_REMOTE_URL (+ OLLAMA_REMOTE_MODEL): an optional Ollama on another\n  machine. Each extract stage probes it (/api/tags, OLLAMA_REMOTE_PROBE_MS)\n  and uses it when it answers and has the model; otherwise it falls back to\n  the local OLLAMA_URL. A retry re-probes, so a laptop that drops out\n  mid-stage is replaced by the local Ollama on the next attempt.\n- The GPU handoff (unload layout models / VLM) runs only when the local\n  Ollama, which shares the GPU with ocr-service, serves the stage.\n- Pin num_ctx per request (OLLAMA_NUM_CTX, default 4096) so a host''s larger\n  OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH cannot inflate the KV cache.\n- Record which Ollama served the stage in processing metadata and events.\n\nC