":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/6ede34c4e6f1daa92acf687ddb1bfb1954bb5b35","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDZlZGUzNGM0ZTZmMWRhYTkyYWNmNjg3ZGRiMWJmYjE5NTRiYjViMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a","sha":"bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a"}],"sha":"6ede34c4e6f1daa92acf687ddb1bfb1954bb5b35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/6ede34c4e6f1daa92acf687ddb1bfb1954bb5b35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:21:56Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:21:56Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(dm-ui): live overview for real campaigns, deeper examples, clean clones\n\nReal campaigns\n- The overview picks the next session from the campaign''s own sessions\n  (earliest upcoming dated session that is not complete, else the lowest\n  open number) when no curated nextSession exists.\n- The server bundle store tracks each object''s last write time and\n  publishes the newest edits as Recent Edits (\"Edited 3 hours ago\").\n- Backlinks fall back to the most-referenced campaign objects.\n\nExample campaigns\n- Ashes of Veyra, Crown of Cinders, Lanterns of Mourningfen and Stars\n  Below Kharad roughly double in depth: more NPCs, factions, quests with\n  objectives, encounters, clues, multi-paragraph handouts and lore,\n  locations, session plans and activity, consistent with each campaign''s\n  lifecycle (active, draft, paused, complete).\n\nStart from this example\n- Cloning resets play-state that only real play or real people produce:\n  no party members, unscheduled draft sessions, fresh session plans,\n  planned acts, not-started quests and pending objectives, unresolved\n  clues, nothing shared with players.\n\nAlso raise the dm-ui test timeout to 15s; section tests now render much\nlarger fixtures in jsdom.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"703118a79072103287e8c78193abfc4163f83462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/703118a79072103287e8c78193abfc4163f83462"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKGJmM2M2ZDE4MDk3ZjdjMDgwMGVlNGZjMDU3NmM3YjU5NTZjNWFjNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337","sha":"1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337"}],"sha":"bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/bf3c6d18097f7c0800ee4fc0576c7b5956c5ac6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:01:47Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T21:01:47Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(delivery): compute affected images against the last promoted release\n\nDelivery diffed against github.event.before. When a push''s promotion was\nskipped as superseded (main moved on before its promote job ran), its images\nwere built under sha-* but never promoted, and the next push only promoted\nthe images it touched itself. The 60c412cf doc-processor retry fix was lost\nthis way: built as sha-3d2f831b, never tagged latest.\n\nResolve now looks up the newest release-images-<sha> artifact, which the\npromote job uploads only for eligible current-main runs under one\nconcurrency group, and diffs against that SHA. Normal pushes behave as\nbefore; after a skipped promotion the diff covers every unpromoted commit.\nA failed lookup, a missing artifact (90-day retention) or a non-ancestor\nSHA falls back to a full rebuild, since over-building is safe and\nunder-building silently drops a release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51aa3b58cabb8f4d089b46fd8cc099303118c24e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/51aa3b58cabb8f4d089b46fd8cc099303118c24e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDFjNTNhNDI3NTk0NzQxYmZlZWJiNjIyYzViNDg2ZTY0MTRlYTQzMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0","sha":"64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0"}],"sha":"1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/1c53a427594741bfeebb622c5b486e6414ea4337"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:39:17Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:39:17Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"feat(dm-ui): one bundle-driven campaign overview for every campaign\n\nAshes of Veyra was the only campaign on the rich dashboard because that\ncomponent imported Ashes data directly and hardcoded its labels and\npaths. The other fixtures fell back to a catalog-only page and real\ncampaigns to static empty tiles, even though every fixture bundle\nalready carries the full data set.\n\n- Build the overview from the campaign bundle (overviewModel.ts) and\n  render it inside SectionRoute/StudioFrame for /demo and /campaigns.\n- Panels collapse (remembered per campaign) and can be focused to show\n  every record with extra detail; rows link to the editable section.\n- Add a Party panel; list resolved clues after open ones.\n- Use container queries so breakpoints follow the space beside the rail.\n- Remove FixtureCampaignOverview and BlankCampaignOverview.\n- Add a data-parity test so every example fills every panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a066abe0050d2433be8d6c4bf498d28d40de5d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/5a066abe0050d2433be8d6c4bf498d28d40de5d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDY0MjYxY2E5Y2RlN2ZiMzUyYjJjYWE2N2VjY2E5MzI0OTJkZTljYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec","sha":"3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec"}],"sha":"64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/64261ca9cde7fb352b2caa67ecca932492de9cb0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:26:48Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:26:48Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(homelab): reconcile compose.yaml with the working nexus-vtt2 deployment\n\nThe live HomePod stack had drifted from the repo, and the repo copy would\nhave broken ingestion if deployed: no PIPELINE_VERSION (doc-processor\ndefaults to v1), no S3 settings on codex-ocr (/layout/s3 reads PDFs from\nGarage), and doc-processor off homelab-net so it could not reach Ollama.\n\nBring the working live settings into the repo while keeping the repo''s\nhardening (:? guards, image overrides, NEXUS_STORAGE_ROOT, metrics tokens):\n- doc-processor: PIPELINE_VERSION v2, OLLAMA_URL, homelab-net (to reach\n  ollama; it has no listener besides token-gated metrics), depends on codex-ocr\n- codex-ocr: S3 settings, hostname, pull_policy always (rolling :latest),\n  LAYOUT_PRELOAD default false for the 6 GB GPU shared with the VLM\n- postgres: scram-sha-256 initdb, pg_isready checks the database\n- redis: --save 60 1; redis/elasticsearch pull_policy if_not_present\n- nexus-forge defaults to :latest; :master is no longer the published tag\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db3713eb4d8fdf914ff455f93c235dd27ab35541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/db3713eb4d8fdf914ff455f93c235dd27ab35541"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDNkMmY4MzFiMTA1MGRjNjc2NzMzOGNhZGJmZGFmOGRhMzRhOGE3ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858","sha":"60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858"}],"sha":"3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/3d2f831b1050dc6767338cadbfdaf8da34a8a7ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:26:42Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:26:42Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(doc-processor): back off GPU stage retries and stop retrying 4xx layout errors\n\nLayout and extract call the GPU in ocr-service. With the queue default of\n3 attempts at 2s/4s backoff, a busy or out-of-memory GPU burned through every\nattempt in about 10 seconds and left the document failed (job 62). Give these\nstages 4 attempts with exponential backoff from 30s (30s, 60s, 120s); layout\ncheckpoints each page batch, so a retry resumes rather than restarts.\n\nA 4xx from /layout/s3 means the request itself is wrong, so throw BullMQ''s\nUnrecoverableError and fail the job immediately instead of retrying.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0389de0c6f4b24b8fc1fb9112e34a68b6900cdbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/0389de0c6f4b24b8fc1fb9112e34a68b6900cdbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDYwYzQxMmNmMTA3ZjhhZmYyMzVkZGQ2NzRmOWExNDM1NjgwOGM4NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f","sha":"c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f"}],"sha":"60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/60c412cf107f8aff235ddd674f9a14356808c858"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:23:22Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T17:23:22Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(codex-ocr): size Marker batches for the 6 GB RTX A2000\n\nWith the font fix in, /layout/s3 got past model setup and then hit CUDA OOM\nin text detection: Marker''s CUDA batch defaults (layout 12, detection 10,\nrecognition 48, ...) assume a larger card, and with the Surya weights\nresident the A2000 has ~1 GB left for activations. Pass conservative batch\nsizes through the Marker config (overridable via MARKER_<KEY>) and enable\nexpandable_segments to cut allocator fragmentation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bbe25f6f91526c0a3b924bd09fefe1a0b53625c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/7bbe25f6f91526c0a3b924bd09fefe1a0b53625c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKGM3NGY1Mjg4N2E0Njk4OWJjOTRlYmYzYzM0YjE2OWVhNGUxNzlhOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/9af8b40b187feee8d159967a977e657fb92fcbcd","sha":"9af8b40b187feee8d159967a977e657fb92fcbcd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/9af8b40b187feee8d159967a977e657fb92fcbcd"}],"sha":"c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/c74f52887a46989bc94ebf3c34b169ea4e179a9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/9af8b40b187feee8d159967a977e657fb92fcbcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:20:06Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:20:06Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(codex-ocr): point Marker''s font dir at the writable /models volume\n\nMarker 1.10.2 defaults FONT_DIR to <site-packages>/static/fonts and\ndownloads GoNotoCurrent-Regular.ttf there on first render. The image runs\nas the non-root app user, so every /layout/s3 call failed with EACCES on\n/opt/venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/static. Set FONT_DIR and FONT_PATH\n(Marker computes the FONT_PATH default from the default FONT_DIR, so both\nare needed) in the image and in the homelab compose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3352c17bb9de0a92d886e5c1ebb8bb5cca17c321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/3352c17bb9de0a92d886e5c1ebb8bb5cca17c321"},"url":"https