1T02:00:38Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:07:07Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"message":"fix(ocr-service): give Marker a writable platformdirs cache under /models\n\nMarker and Surya resolve ~/.cache through platformdirs, which is /app/.cache and\nroot-owned, so the non-root app user could not write there. Set XDG_CACHE_HOME to\n/models/cache in the image and the homelab compose service, create and chown /app\nand /models/cache in the Dockerfile, and document that the models volume must be\nwritable by uid 1001.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ef3d41765895a4a06d1853fe64b1c19ea9686ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/0ef3d41765895a4a06d1853fe64b1c19ea9686ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/7e0b9237e051518aadd94e60b66b79db41a3bcef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},