 four example campaigns now names an SRD monster, so\ncloning an example links each one to the catalog and difficulty is calculated.\nWhere an idea had no SRD equivalent the nearest creature stands in and the\nruleset notes say so. Hazards and lair actions carry nonCreature: they have no\nstat block, are not rated, are excluded from participant totals and are never\nspawned on deploy. Tests keep future examples from reintroducing unmatched names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48db59d894c0f50f1d7e3627a54e234463f91315","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/48db59d894c0f50f1d7e3627a54e234463f91315"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/5b83702976d22ff684b1560aa0aecabb0ab7f8c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/5b83702976d22ff684b1560aa0aecabb0ab7f8c6","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDViODM3MDI5NzZkMjJmZjY4NGIxNTYwYWEwYWVjYW