ic"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/90afda31117c35f70de7ca6d7de727fa7525ddd7","node_id":"C_kwDOP1mfj9oAKDkwYWZkYTMxMTE3YzM1ZjcwZGU3Y2E2ZDdkZTcyN2ZhNzUyNWRkZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale/nexusVTT/commit/cff57e3de6c357ed899078fdddd0f886b6d80de6","sha":"cff57e3de6c357ed899078fdddd0f886b6d80de6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/cff57e3de6c357ed899078fdddd0f886b6d80de6"}],"sha":"90afda31117c35f70de7ca6d7de727fa7525ddd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/90afda31117c35f70de7ca6d7de727fa7525ddd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2914345?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joelmale","id":2914345,"login":"joelmale","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTQzNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/cff57e3de6c357ed899078fdddd0f886b6d80de6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:58:58Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T23:58:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Database-authoritative join codes, quick-start campaigns, guest session discard (#388)\n\n* feat(vtt): database-authoritative join codes and quick-start campaign title/description\n\n- createSession/createSessionWithJoinCode insert with ON CONFLICT (joinCode) DO\n  NOTHING inside the session transaction; bounded retry with a clear error\n- remove ConnectionLifecycle.generateRoomCode; default connections pass no code\n- quick-start hosts can supply a campaign title/description (lobby + WS params)\n- integration tests: concurrent collisions, quick-start owner vs player access\n- integration vitest config runs files serially (shared truncated DB)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(vtt): discard guest-hosted sessions when the host leaves; simplify DM setup\n\n- guest host disconnect schedules deletion of its campaign+session after a 2 min\n  grace; a host reconnect cancels it; signed-in hosts are never discarded\n- DM setup passes title/description as the quick-start campaign draft\n- drop duration and game type fields from DM setup\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(lobby): reduce account dropdown width by half\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f196d87fc5600c9f0a75c5b005f7bfb1e25cb714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/f196d87fc5600c9f0a75c5b005f7bfb1e25cb714"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/commits/cff57e3de6c357ed899078fdddd0f886b6d80de6","verification":{"payload":"tree f196d87fc5600c9f0a75c5b005f7bfb1e25cb714\nparent 41d1aefe039c4aec78dc380437f80be0d0054952\nauthor Joel Nelson <joelmale@gmail.com> 1790812738 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790812738 -0400\n\nDatabase-authoritative join codes, quick-start campaigns, guest session discard (#388)\n\n* feat(vtt): database-authoritative join codes and quick-start campaign title/description\n\n- createSession/createSessionWithJoinCode insert with ON CONFLICT (joinCode) DO\n  NOTHING inside the session transaction; bounded retry with a clear error\n- remove ConnectionLifecycle.generateRoomCode; default connections pass no code\n- quick-start hosts can supply a campaign title/description (lobby + WS params)\n- integration tests: concurrent collisions, quick-start owner vs player access\n- integration vitest config runs files serially (shared truncated DB)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(vtt): discard guest-hosted sessions when the host leaves; simplify DM setup\n\n- guest host disconnect schedules deletion of its campaign+session after a 2 min\n  grace; a host reconnect cancels it; signed-in hosts are never discarded\n- DM setup passes title/description as the quick-start campaign draft\n- drop duration and game type fields from DM setup\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style(lobby): reduce account dropdown width by half\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvaJCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+NkQACyJWx20rSXyAYcb+aoziazE\n9FYsRbY814Ej6Hl1esm1GPQatb3iORILTO7EcKUWCor9XMP2lFjmAO+7OdCYcKg8\nNWt8jKjRVZvTooSLrH8Lc6EtO50/KucVLSHN9hiueGyO4uSc0caS69muOz2auKwC\nyVllq8O/fDCNk9e7QStdokEUhczZeWtUZjHAkMCVoRTECZsCT/8J3XWdbtO7RvNK\nka/nKn+UzawCCqLeY3wIvmcv4vTbUnUdhn4ffHWkBuJDK5yHLO767bhleM4ZBv2w\n0JE32cy7/rRJf26useeo3DGUsK6488TlSQwXq3VRec2QoYEHPcGarGjKry/OJNF+\n+/fBk9Q3CUn/mlQChsqER81HbdTa1LRvFUxQ4Q6tf+rvSEVPizZ1Hf8EkgLU3ZmF\nTwq4lxIv2b3hUErOSIahn59nfklRYarkQxGPnMJMBENxe9QwXAWmfUhg5SYBN27X\n0xJhjnoDI1cKjf3xG3sYprlY9HXm9k7mfD2ypWeGejmpZOR7kebYHq1pGHD7cvUJ\n/hum+/HvRkEstS+xpS3x2gY17Vhm2FIknIwSQv9QCu1i0s+Uz1vFHSwGg8Kpdool\nU+XxfQzdu6b3XEiA35bccn4weXipw9PA7mMUii9/ljBoN1VDz5S0biN0D5nEa0Qm\nbbiNjiHvEdb9Qww6q2qy\n=0NAa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T23:58:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}"