/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joelmale","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/commits/0c8a7ecd0f8a22b0cc2ffca9e3cb696c82c9aeee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:26:55Z","email":"joelmale@gmail.com","name":"Joel Nelson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:26:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(codex): Live Proof redesign with pipeline stepper and SSE event stream (#387)\n\n- doc-processor: publish each stored processing event to Redis\n  (codex:pipeline:events:<doc>); new step_started/step_completed (chunking,\n  indexing), crop_dispatched (crop geometry -> Ollama) and throttled GPU\n  telemetry events; page_layout carries totalPages, s/page and the stat\n  blocks detected on the page; VLM timings in entity messages.\n- ocr-service: /health reports gpu_temperature_c.\n- control-api: GET codex admin/processing/:id/stream (codex:read), a\n  Server-Sent Events stream over doc-api''s event cursor. Resumes from\n  Last-Event-ID, woken by an optional Redis doorbell (CODEX_REDIS_URL),\n  polls without it, 15 s heartbeats, ends itself after 10 min.\n- admin-ui: Live Proof becomes the Processing hero. \"CODEX INGESTION\n  ENGINE\" header with Lexicon Match and ACTIVE chips; five-step v2 stepper\n  (live timers, Page N/M, s/page, click to filter artifacts and console);\n  honest v1 banner and empty-state note; labelled stat-block / lore-callout\n  / filtered-art tags; artifact footer [JSON Schema] [Parsed: N]; action\n  console with source prefixes and a pinned GPU telemetry line; follows\n  system dark mode. EventSource with polling fallback.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46ee0bcccb72b5689d5bd0701ecf50e47c54b620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joelmale/nexusVTT/git/trees/46ee0bcccb72b5689d5bd0701ecf50e47c54b62