 Bill Ticona Remond"},"message":"refactor: filtro diagnóstico por concepto UUIDs directos + certainty inglés\n\nMetamodelo: FiltroDiagnostico.concepto_uuid → concepto_uuids: list[str]\n- Permite múltiples UUIDs por ítem (OR interno) con mismo tipo_diagnóstico\n\nSQL engine: JOIN concept c y filtro por c.uuid IN (:uuids)\n- Sin resolver concept_map — UUIDs van directo al query\n- certainty: definitivo→CONFIRMED, presuntivo→PROVISIONAL (inglés)\n- El campo real de OpenMRS es certainty, no diagnosis_type\n\nFrontend: DiagnosticoSelector multi-select con chips removibles\n- Maneja string[] en vez de string único\n- Chips con UUID truncado y botón × para quitar\n\nSeed IRA: actualizado con concepto_uuids placeholder","tree":{"sha":"c2e8f08c7a65484c2ecaff67644e7bd880ae90ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sihsalus/reportes-sql/git/trees/c2e8f08c7a65484c2ecaff67644e7bd880ae90ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sihsalus/reportes-sql/git/commits/fd891f71e0c7db710ae08730778e89893933c9f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209058005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andbtr","id":209058005,"login":"andbtr","node_id":"U_kgDODHX41Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr","us