\nBackend: nuevo endpoint GET /conceptos/diagnosticos/buscar?q=\n- Proxy a OpenMRS v=full con extracción de código CIE-10 desde names[]\n- Response model: {uuid, codigo, nombre} con fallbacks\n- 400 en query vacía, 502 en fallos de conexión\n\nFrontend: componente DiagnosticoSelector con debounce 300ms\n- Container+presentational split (mismo patrón que EncounterTypeSelector)\n- TanStack Query con enabled >= 2 chars y staleTime 60s\n- Integrado en IndicadorForm vía Controller reemplazando input de texto\n- MSW handler con fixtures para tests\n\nInfra: symlinks .agents, .atl, .engram → dev-config-indicators","tree":{"sha":"24f45808047e34819d154279498605a9d11745ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sihsalus/reportes-sql/git/trees/24f45808047e34819d154279498605a9d11745ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sihsalus/reportes-sql/git/commits/555d1787eec961acf4ae8f5a710a0654e62a01d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209058005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andbtr","id":209058005,"login":"andbtr","node_id":"U_kgDODHX41Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andbtr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/sihsalus/reportes-sql/commit/555d1787eec961acf4ae8f5